  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Aerodynamic** (1 other source): Lyric altered to include the phrase \"watch the whole world go by\" [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Phantom Island**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Deadstick**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Lonely Cosmos**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Eternal Return**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Panpsych**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Spacesick**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Aerodynamic**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Sea of Doubt**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-11-04** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 142 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Covent Garden Sinfonia performed, led by conductor Chad Kelly [1]\n- Band declared it the best day of their lives before starting [1]\n- Joey inquired if audience members attended previous Brixton concerts [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-11-04**: taped by Tora Tapes; transferred by Tora Tapes; source: FOB > Zoom F3 + CA-14 > WAV > Audacity > WAV [1]. Also: Captured via Zoom F3 and CA-14 microphones, including orchestra sections and outro [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Blaxteeco: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard London UK 2025 Event Poster Orchestra Show At Royal Albert Hall On November 4 2025 Ho](https://blaxteeco.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-london-uk-2025-event-poster-orchestra-show-at-royal-albert-hall-on-november-4-2025-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [3]",
